WEBVTT

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:47.090
<b>Iron Town</b>

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:09.860
Shifting to cleaning mode.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.270
I will not stop until I have 
eliminated all of the trash

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.870
in the Kabuki district.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.740
It's cleaning time.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:33.130
What's with them?!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.760
They're like little demons!

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.620
Who are they?!

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.730
Why are these monsters 
working for that old hag?!

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.730
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.450
You could say that Otose

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.480
has the power to attract such people.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:47.380
We have no choice then.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.480
Time to get serious.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.150
Saigo!

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.860
Too bad, Bro.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.200
You were trying to buy time 
by fighting a bunch of chumps,

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.620
but that cat burglar of 
yours won't be coming back.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:05.870
She won't be able to steal Saigo's son.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.880
Even if she manages to 
make it to Teruhiko-kun,

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.930
Kada's people and my old 
man will be waiting.

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:15.100
It's pretty much impossible for her

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.510
to make it back alive.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:19.350
That's what you were trying to do...

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:23.140
There's no point in trying to 
avoid a fight with Saigo-san.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.980
Look what will happen 
if you take too long.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.980
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.980
Otose-san's bar is going to burn down.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.380
The building's on fire!

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.150
Oh, no!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.160
We have to put it out!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.320
You're leaving?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.970
I believe that you barely have 
enough fighters as it is.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:41.200
You're pretty brutal 
for a little shrimp.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.080
I'm starting to like you.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:48.210
But I'll need to separate your 
head from your body first.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:51.090
I've always liked you, Bro.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.090
But you have to join my old man first.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.960
Actually, you should just marry me.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:01.100
That's the only way for you 
to survive in this town.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:05.100
You guys are all alone 
with no coming to help.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.650
All alone with no help?

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:14.280
I don't think so.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.410
At least, there's one person 
here who's willing to help.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.100
Yeah, Gin-san?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:20.660
You're...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.290
...Tatsumi the firefighter!

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:24.860
Who are you?!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:25.690
Trying to interfere?!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.210
Die!

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:30.210
That's some weak iron.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.460
You can't even scratch 
these guys with that junk.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.850
Want me to reforge that for you?

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:40.470
Te-Tetsuko!

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:42.550
Don't take us lightly!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.100
Hey, now.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:47.560
A lady doesn't like it 
when you gang up on her.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:54.360
Yes, a man should be hard-boiled, Camus

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.360
Kozenigata-san! Haji-san!

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.610
What's with that weird-looking bunch?!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.740
Master Gengai!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.500
Hey! There's a freak mixed in there!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.370
Can't let this bar be shut down!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.000
No more free drinks for me!

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.070
You have a running tab.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.630
Why am I the only one who 
gets the cold shoulder?!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.500
The Members of Odd Jobs, you are not alone.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.640
They have forged a bond during 
their time in this town.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.460
What?! Now we have an 
army of male escorts!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:29.520
The Kabuki district women 
may cry once I'm gone.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.900
But I will cry once you're gone.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:39.010
How very naughty of you 
to seduce a male escort.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.150
Kyoshiro-san!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:44.260
We won't let you carry the burden alone.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.780
And here are a bunch of cabaret girls!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.610
It's not very nice to decide the fate of

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.320
the Kabuki district on your own.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.170
This town doesn't belong to any of you.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:57.300
It belongs to us cabaret girls.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.930
The Jirocho gang and tranny 
gang can bring it on.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.420
We'll show you how terrifying

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.800
the Kabuki district truly is.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.620
We won't let you have your way here!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.810
Those guys helped protect 
the things we care about.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.490
They know what it truly 
means to be hard-boiled.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.820
They're the hardest-boiled 
bunch in Edo, Camus.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.910
I'll never be able to pay you back.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:26.330
But I also won't forget 
what you've taught me.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.030
Please watch us.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.960
This time, we will protect the 
things we care about ourselves...

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:36.040
<b>Kabuki District 1st Street</b>

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:35.580
Our Kabuki District...

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:40.460
Our precious friends, the 
members of Odd Jobs...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.730
We've lived together and

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.470
shared laughs in this filthy town.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.540
In that case, we should suck it up and

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.720
protect this town together.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:52.100
You are the ones who have become 
enemies of the Kabuki district.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.850
You're in our town.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.610
E-Everyone...

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.520
What's with these people?!

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:01.990
Young lady, they 
completely outnumber us!

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:06.580
Is that supposed to matter?

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.100
We're up against a bunch of amateurs!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.910
Take them all out!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:10.740
Yeah!

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.500
We can't let a bunch of 
cabaret girls boss us around!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.210
A bunch of cabaret girls, you said?

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.390
Get down on your knees.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.220
I am the queen of the Kabuki district.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:27.590
Idiot!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.850
Are you trying to protect 
this town or destroy it?!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.390
Don't forget that you 
have allies down here!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.100
Straighten out your act or 
I'll have to punish you!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.000
If the town gets destroyed, 
we can rebuild it.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.940
This time, we can build 
a sturdy iron town.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.570
What are you talking about?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.950
We already live in an iron town.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:48.450
Gin-san, you guys go 
settle this business!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.650
We'll handle the small fry here!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.450
You're the small fry!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.060
That's the difference between you,
 who takes things that others hold dear,

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:08.430
and them, who protect the 
things that others hold dear.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:13.020
You should know when a 
battle is lost, Saigo-san.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.720
Leave.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.270
This battle is our...

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.770
...Gran's victory.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.440
As long as Saigo-san and I are here,

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.800
your crowd doesn't stand a chance.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.900
I won't let you go to my old man.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:28.530
I said that you already lost.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:31.530
You've really pissed them off.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.870
Stay out of this, curly head!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.770
I'm disappointed, Pako.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:39.500
You're going to let a couple 
of kids throw their lives away?

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.060
So be it.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.380
I'd rather disappoint you 
than disappoint them.

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.900
A couple of softies who 
didn't want to fight

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.470
Saigo-san are supposed to put up a fight?

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:53.220
Looks like I'll need to rip your 
head off to make you understand.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:58.980
True, we were softies 
who let you use us.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.710
You tricked us, betrayed us,

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.120
but we'll be able to laugh 
it off in a couple of days.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:08.030
I'm used to having girls trick me.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.780
But, no matter your reasons...

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:17.960
We can never forgive you for hurting...

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.460
...the Kabuki district's mother.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.210
Don't underestimate Odd Jobs.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.540
We won't let you hurt anyone else.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.800
You won't have your way around here.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.800
We aren't alone!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.360
Now that the three members 
of Odd Jobs are together,

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:35.260
you won't be taking 
anything else from us!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.930
It's time to show you the power...

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.060
...that has kept Odd Jobs safe.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.950
It would be rude to go easy

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:44.310
on someone with such fierce eyes.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.120
I understand.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:49.570
Then I'll turn you into corpses first.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.610
Where would you like me to 
make some bright red flowers?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.080
Your head?

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.330
Or your chest?

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.330
Or...

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.420
...Bro's heart?

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.430
There won't be any flowers.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.930
Flowers aren't for samurai.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.080
Flowers are meant for girls.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.780
And trannies.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:37.810
Huh...

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.700
That's strange...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.790
How could I...

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:51.780
I can't let them reach my old man.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:54.670
I'm gonna...

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.080
You used the back of your blade?

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.060
You're still softies.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.600
You hit my chin so hard 
that my head's spinning.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.320
I won't be able to stand anytime soon.

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:12.530
Damn. Guess I can't stop you.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.820
You're just as soft.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.740
Yeah, I'm gonna talk 
to myself for a bit.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.330
Don't pay any attention.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.710
We'll take care of your kid.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.790
Rest easy and get some 
beauty sleep or ugly sleep.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.460
Then I'll also talk to myself for a bit.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.450
Don't get yourselves killed.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.050
I leave the Kabuki district,

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:40.530
our town, in your hands, Odd Jobs.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:49.980
This town looks pretty meek 
when there's nobody around.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:53.120
Easier for your daughter to do her job.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.110
The red light district will soon 
be a playground for children.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.620
Don't you mean it will be the 
hunting ground for a certain vixen?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.990
Are you here to keep an eye on me?

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:05.130
You think I would skip a sumo match

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:09.250
to come all the way out here 
and waste my time on you?

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:13.630
I'm here for the vixen's head.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.390
Hallelujah!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.110
I'm next!

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.050
And then me!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.010
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:25.900
Wouldn't you want to be sent 
to heaven by Kyoshiro's rod?!

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.380
Uh, he's using a real blade!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.830
They're literally going to heaven!

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.830
And what's going on?!

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.100
The others have been understanding

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.430
of our situation and have shown mercy,

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:38.030
but that guy won't stop 
slaughtering trannies!

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:39.280
Stay back.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.610
Agomi?!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.760
I recognize his technique.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:47.300
A special assassination technique 
for slaying trannies.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.530
Blade of the Male Escort!

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:49.770
<b>Blade of the Male Escort!</b>

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.790
That sounds familiar!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.680
A thousand years ago,

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.780
during the great war between 
male escort and tranny,

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:57.460
this legendary technique was born
 during the Battle of Bootyloo.

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.300
I didn't realize that someone 
had inherited the technique it.

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.540
This was the last place I expected

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.310
to run into the dreaded 
foe of all trannies.

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.270
That stance, it can't be...!

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:10.260
You were too hasty.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:13.630
Yes, I have inherited the

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:18.240
Kama-sen-ryu which counters 
the Blade of the Male Escort!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.030
I am Agomi, King of Fist!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.800
Sorry, never heard of you.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:22.910
Ago!

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:27.370
So you were willing to sever 
this cursed chin of mine...

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.710
I have no chins in this life!

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.200
Yeah, you do!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.790
You've got one long-ass chin there!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.610
Oh, you're right.

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:36.420
He didn't cut it off?

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:40.050
Uh, could you pretend to be dead?

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:44.260
A male escort is only 
allowed to penetrate women.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.880
A toy?

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.550
Kyoshiro!

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:51.520
You were acting to keep 
us from getting hurt!

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:53.500
I don't care if you use the sword

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.990
up here or the sword down there!

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:55.940
Penetrate me!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:56.730
Penetrat--

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.160
What are you doing?

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.470
We're getting out of here.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.030
Mama!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.760
This fight is over.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.240
We've lost.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.760
Saigo-san...

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.540
I can't accept that.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.960
My old man hasn't 
conquered the world yet.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.070
If you want to help 
him conquer the world,

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.960
you shouldn't waste his men out here.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.720
We don't need these useless chumps.

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:23.090
Go ahead and turn your
 back on us if you wish.

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:27.100
I'll support my old man by 
myself if that's what it takes.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.290
I don't believe it.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:34.730
He backstabbed his own relatives 
for the sake of business.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:38.310
The wife and daughter 
you abandoned are here.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:42.030
Doesn't matter what 
people say about him...

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.560
This is the end.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.910
We never want anything 
to do with you again.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.470
I see.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.220
I assumed that it was 
over a long time ago.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:55.540
Doesn't matter if he 
never looks at me...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.100
I see...

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.920
So he's still making mischief.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.130
How can you smile?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:07.140
He abandoned us and started 
doing terrible things

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:08.640
for the sake of a woman...

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.140
Before he left for the war,

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.900
he placed his hand here and promised...

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.150
...that he would surely return.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:23.530
Pirako, he hasn't returned 
from the war yet.

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.540
He's still fighting right now.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:34.790
<b>Medicine for Ingesting</b>

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.410
But once he's finished, he'll return.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.550
After all, the one thing 
he knew how to do was

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.790
to keep his promises.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.540
So don't hate him.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.710
Once I'm gone,

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.420
there won't be anyone on his side.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:46.680
We have his promise...

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:50.970
You will be the only one 
who believes in him...

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.190
He promised...

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:59.360
You'll come back to me, won't you?

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:04.610
He promised to return...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.580
Reinforcements from Kada?!

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.490
Take care of this.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.000
I need to go to my old man.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.620
Young lady!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.220
So we were all played 
by that damn vixen.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.300
Mama!

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:30.760
Sa-Saigo-san...

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.530
Using a kid to set off 
a war in this town

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.020
and manipulate the Four Devas 
into wearing each other down

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:41.420
in order to take control of this town.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:45.770
That should be the general 
gist of your plan.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.280
But it's too late.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:52.080
Those pathetic monkeys are 
being crushed as we speak.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.330
Along with your daughter.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:58.950
I doubt that they're 
gonna roll over for you.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:04.590
Well, this means I get a private
 meeting with a beautiful lady.

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:07.590
We won't be having that.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.590
Though I've prepared a little party.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.680
Shinra?

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:18.060
Along with Yato and 
Dakini in your troops,

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.810
it's clear that you're 
not just some gambler.

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:25.590
My long battle with you ends here.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:27.750
This town belongs to me now.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.080
Or should I say...

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.940
It belongs to Kada,

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:35.330
captain of the 4th squad of 
the space pirates Harusame?

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:39.830
You've finally revealed 
your true colors, vixen?

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.910
Nonsense.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.160
You already knew my identity.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.610
If it weren't for you,

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.490
I would've taken over this town the way

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:50.470
Hosen took over Yoshiwara.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.230
I know the reason

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:57.850
you were willing to sink so 
low to protect this town.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:01.650
You were protecting this 
town from us Amanto.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:04.990
I learned two things from the war.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:10.260
First, at this rate, we'll 
be swallowed by you Amanto.

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:13.320
Second, we are completely powerless.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:17.160
Take care of her...  
Take care of our town...

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:19.430
If you still want to protect 
what's dear to you,

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.290
you'll have to change.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.960
I gave up on being a human 
so I could defeat you.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.960
Kada, I can't say much 
for any other town,

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.300
but this place won't go 
down without a fight.

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:36.140
Your vaunted Four Devas have 
perished, leaving you alone.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.840
What can you possibly accomplish?

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:43.140
Have you been paying any 
attention to this town?

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.020
Don't underestimate the Kabuki District.

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.070
Who are you people?!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.120
Sorry to keep you waiting, dark dude.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.080
I've been waiting for you, silver kid.

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:00.250
I'd like to return the favor,

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.620
but I guess the situation's changed.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.250
You've got sharp eyes.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.150
So while we were engaged 
in a pointless fight,

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:14.050
they took control of this town.

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:16.030
Sa-Saigo-san...

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:16.680
Why?

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:20.830
Hostages are only useful alive.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:25.110
I consider you a hostage 
to use against Jirocho.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:27.800
Besides, I've had enough.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.600
I don't want to see any old ladies

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.820
or naughty kids bite the dust.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.520
Our enemy is elsewhere...

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.810
Mama! Hang in there, Mama!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.700
But it's too late when you realize it.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.950
I can't believe it...

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.330
Saigo's spent.

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:49.840
The rest of us can barely fight.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.460
We're finished!

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.470
The Amanto are gonna take 
over our Kabuki District!

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.220
Good grief.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:01.340
Could you stop whining?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:05.030
And you call yourself 
Kabuki District residents?

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.980
That voice is...

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:12.230
Bold and bullheaded, 
adamant and adaptable.

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:15.240
Isn't that our creed?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.360
O-O...

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.370
Otose!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.670
Shinpachi, Kagura...

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.630
I'm leaving Saigo's kid to you.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.750
We're running out of time.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:27.280
Gin-chan...

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.750
We promised.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.820
I'm trusting you to do as I ask,

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:34.280
so have some faith in me.

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:36.190
Gin-san...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.180
We'll meet back up in 
the Kabuki district.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:47.130
I'm not sure why you're here,

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:50.440
but you're trying to allow 
those kids to escape?

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.190
It's not like that.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.180
They wouldn't be able to hold

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.690
themselves back against you people.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.950
It's R-18 time.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:02.360
I don't know the details, 
but one thing's for sure.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.830
I'm killing the old man and you, and we're all killing each other.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.090
You got balls to talk like that to

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.180
the mighty Jirocho and 
the Harusame, kid.

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:16.490
But it's easy to understand.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:17.720
Count me in, kid.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.050
I'm gonna slaughter you all.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.580
We're all alone here 
with no help in sight.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:26.060
Just cut down anything that moves.

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:30.130
The last one standing is the winner.

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:32.310
Nice and simple, the way I like it.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.600
You probably had bad grades.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.640
Not as bad as yours.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.260
What's so funny?!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:43.450
Why are you laughing?!

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:47.650
Don't you realize the 
situation you're in?!

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.920
You and your town are finished!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:57.760
Damn old man!

00:21:57.760 --> 00:21:59.930
Kid!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.120
Don't die...

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:11.020
...until I kill you.

00:23:40.070 --> 00:23:45.070
<b>Next Episode
'Tis an Honor!</b>
